✨ Key features

Sales and objective tracking for 2024 (with 2025 data where available)

Breakdowns by Boutique and Mois (Jan–Déc sorted correctly via NoMois)

KPI cards & combo charts: CA Total 2024 vs Objectif CA 2024, % Atteinte, Écart

Diagnostics visuals (contrôle OK/KO, deltas absolus/relatifs)

Reusable, documented DAX measures

🧱 Data model (star)

Dimensions

DimDate – Date, Année, Mois, NoMois, AnMo

DimBoutique – Boutique

Facts

FactSales – historical sales (multi-year)

FactSales2024 – filtered/specialised 2024 view for performance KPIs

Objectifs2024 – imported table with OBJECTIF CHIFFRE D'AFFAIRE TOT.

Relationships

DimDate[Date] → FactSales[DateOK] / FactSales2024[DateOK] / Objectifs2024[DateOK] (one-to-many, single direction)

DimBoutique[Boutique] → [Boutique] in each fact (one-to-many, single direction)

Keep a pure star (no fact-to-fact joins). If you can’t relate Objectifs2024, use TREATAS (see DAX below).

🧮 DAX (core measures)
-- Always scoped to 2024 via the calendar
CA Total 2024 =
CALCULATE( SUM(FactSales[CA Total]), DimDate[Année] = 2024 )

-- If Objectifs2024 is RELATED via DimDate & DimBoutique
Objectif CA 2024 =
CALCULATE( SUM(Objectifs2024[OBJECTIF CHIFFRE D'AFFAIRE TOT.]), DimDate[Année] = 2024 )

-- Fallback if no relationship to Objectifs2024 (project filters)
Objectif CA 2024 (sans relation) =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(Objectifs2024[OBJECTIF CHIFFRE D'AFFAIRE TOT.]),
    TREATAS( VALUES(DimDate[Date]), Objectifs2024[DateOK] ),
    TREATAS( VALUES(DimBoutique[Boutique]), Objectifs2024[Boutique] ),
    DimDate[Année] = 2024
)

Écart CA 2024 =
[CA Total 2024] - [Objectif CA 2024]  -- or the (sans relation) version

% Atteinte CA 2024 =
DIVIDE( [CA Total 2024], [Objectif CA 2024] )


Other frequently used measures in the model:

CA Diff, CA Diff Abs, CA Contrôle, CA Contrôle OK ?

CA Flora, CA Tiers, Part Flora (CA) %

Pieces KPIs (Flora/Tiers vendues)

