⚠️ Known data notes

2025: some boutiques lack CA Article Flora / CA Tiers ⇒ derivative measures may be blank or volatile.

% Atteinte > 100% is normal when CA > Objectif (e.g., 248% means 2.48× the target).

Use DIVIDE to safely handle division by zero in % KPIs.

If you see (Vide) on boutiques in visuals, check the relationship and field source on the axis/legend.

🚀 Getting started

